  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-账户、客户与资质\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"更新客户账号设置的预算类型与预算，需通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token，预算模式可选值及预算值有相应要求。\",\"id\":\"ad.advertiser.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/advertiser/update/budget/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710531631116\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"/open_api/获取Access token接口路径（文档未明确）/\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710531631116\",\"title\":\"更新账户日预算\"}",
