e%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22jRhbK%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-1isq7zptpsow00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5e8vfmra9o0000\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t33hpkm6u-1qwjsfg9a8v400\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3h5qu6r3zjm000\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-32m1pwl04x4000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-5i47n0clozo000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1eba4knwvslc00\">budget_mode <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22rfScO%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-2b36enodvio000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4crm5gakufq00\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t33hpkm6u-54p8jq8mirs000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2f2rrx5nud0k00\">预算模式，详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【附录-枚举值】</a>，可选值:<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">BUDGET_MODE_DAY</code>（日预算）<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">BUDGET_MODE_INFINITE</code>（不限）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1m23zymf31sw00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t33hpnutm-4r2a9mnciio000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-11kx7xbzfl3k00\">budget <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-add\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22add%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22iKovF%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#5ca537;background:#d8eecd;\">条件必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t33hpnutm-1rzlo3x6mra800\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2yfgrby3x88000\">float</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t33hpygq4-jui36zfosw000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3fc97lef5pg000\">预算值，取值范围：1000～9999999.99，<span style=\"color: #f43d0e;\">当budget